1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,963
For safety alerts, PNCC Care uses a dependable Dual-Timer and Emergency Escalation architecture.

2
00:00:06,963 --> 00:00:12,843
Timer 1 governs the senior's local check-in frequency with gentle on-device reminders.

3
00:00:12,843 --> 00:00:24,670
Timer 2 is the caregiver alert timeout, which must be set longer than Timer 1, notifying family only when inactivity truly exceeds safe thresholds to eliminate false alarms.

4
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:32,123
If caregivers do not acknowledge the critical alert, the system can escalate to prepare a 911 emergency call.

5
00:00:32,123 --> 00:00:38,960
Combined with hardware fall detection and shake-to-panic, it ensures real safety when seconds count.
